<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>SC Andes Mallorca Ep 102, 2011</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;EM&gt;[The Strike Commander story goes on, with the Wildcats now deploying to war-torn South America.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Follows &lt;STRONG&gt;SC&amp;nbsp;Andes Mallorca&amp;nbsp;Ep 101 - 2011&lt;/STRONG&gt;]&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Background&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr&gt;
&lt;P&gt;The past twenty years has seen unprecedented world-wide upheaval with the uncivil fracturing of the Soviet Union, failed interventions in the Mid-East and continental environmental disasters.&amp;nbsp; Across the globe&amp;nbsp;old political orders fall, energy resources dwindle&amp;nbsp;and economies collapse.&amp;nbsp; Mercenaries become a commonplace tool as governments and powerful corporations vie among each other to protect or assert their interests.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BLOCKQUOTE&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Andes Mallorca,&amp;nbsp;August 2011&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr&gt;
&lt;P&gt;After several days of sustained operations in the Andes theater the Wildcats take advantage of a bad weather front&amp;nbsp;to get some much needed rest and repair.&amp;nbsp; The enemy has other ideas, however.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BLOCKQUOTE&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
